1
00:00:00,976 --> 00:00:05,506
No, no. You've always wanted to send your
food back in a restaurant. Here's your chance.

2
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:09,240
- That's okay. I just won't eat them.
- Don't be ridiculous. Waiter?

3
00:00:10,752 --> 00:00:11,942
(Waiter:)Everything all right?

4
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:16,954
(Lucy:)Uh, yeah. Everything all right with you?

5
00:00:17,125 --> 00:00:18,145
(Sheldon:)Yes.

6
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,990
- Okay, thanks, bye.
- Hold on.

7
00:00:22,931 --> 00:00:24,761
(Raj:)Isn't there something else
you wanted to tell him?

8
00:00:26,334 --> 00:00:31,634
No, it's fine. He's from a different country.
He doesn't understand our ways.

9
00:00:34,142 --> 00:00:35,632
(Raj:)Don't be silly. Just tell him.

10
00:00:37,445 --> 00:00:41,045
(Lucy:)I have to go to the bathroom. And it's not
because the crab cakes are funky.

11
00:00:43,485 --> 00:00:47,475
- So you're okay here?
- Uh, yeah, sorry. She's just a little shy.

12
00:00:47,689 --> 00:00:50,019
(Raj:)The first time we met, she was so nervous...

13
00:00:50,191 --> 00:01:07,031
(Raj:)...she climbed out
a bathroom window to get away.

